{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a07069ee576cc7136c539472da45a28c97d9d1d5eea4a0fc36bb11c8e0e98383", "ja": "魔法学園の日常～教師の場合～", "zh": "魔法学园的日常～教师篇～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c980544be6150eef6a984d3fd3604f056200601f315aabca7acae231587ff3c2", "ja": "学園の定例会に出席する真美、麗花、朋花。\n話題はおのずと新入生の翼と可奈になる。\n定例会後、真美の元気のなさを心配する麗花\nと、真美の立場が変わった事でパートナーの\n亜美との関係について仄めかす朋花。", "zh": "真美、丽花和朋花出席学园的例会。\n话题自然而然地转到了新生翼和可奈身上。\n例会结束后，丽花担心真美无精打采，\n朋花则暗指真美立场的改变对其与搭档\n亚美之间关系带来的影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7dab058848715a4137368e678c331e71fac06a0e967158a40538fb02296ff099", "ja": "教職員・監督生　合同定例会議……", "zh": "教职员·级长　联合例行会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "88c43205c0335091f2efa631fd00555471896b84230294f5750ad757e6ecf7da", "ja": "……。学園の定例会なのに、出席者3名……。\nこれだから魔法使いって……。", "zh": "……明明是学园的例会，出席者却只有3名……\n魔法使真是不管哪个都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "3841de9d43610b803baf511bd804b4d12cdc1d5362ce49d4c169c02b6dd195cc", "ja": "はいはーい♪　真美先生は魔法使いなのに\n毎回出席してて、すっごくえらいと思います！", "zh": "好啦好啦♪真美老师明明是魔法师，却每次都来出席，我觉得真的特别了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "9a01f244c7c327a3d0edba1e6c0789ded5301148b9874c30aa3c73952fd822ff", "ja": "ありがと。……それじゃ、まず新入生の件だけど。\n学園長、何か言ってた？", "zh": "谢谢你。……那么，首先是关于新生那件事。\n学园长有说什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "16fce619b02b1346cae9d9c503856f32e386c38e2bd91691602f5ddf946dc537", "ja": "学園が活気づいて、良かったと仰っていましたよ～。\n魔法界に呼べる人間は、100年ぶりですからね～。", "zh": "学园能热闹起来，校长觉得很欣慰呢～。\n毕竟这可是时隔100年，才再次有人类能被召唤到魔法界来呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "8e72f6591c798748250092541852645356a16bb74457567cc25f0c16e680e179", "ja": "彼女に手紙を届けたのは、学園長ですが……\n「導かれてそうしただけ」とも。", "zh": "把信送到她手上的虽然是学园长……\n但她也说过，自己“只是顺应指引而为”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "787eb1eee5f0abf1bd43a5739beba06190638e294fa7eb4ac5d03d96c29b0640", "ja": "『世界は理のあるがままに動く』……\n学園長、いつもどおりって感じですね！", "zh": "《世界按照规律运转》……学园长还是一如既往呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "4855adbc11fe7ec0f8706980a31ab06b2949c3b7d3071e0d78ce250cf36c0432", "ja": "そう。それで、パートナーとの相性は？\n可奈は、不満があるみたいだけど。", "zh": "没错。那么，和搭档的相性如何？\n可奈好像有些不满呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "be5b17fe2bf987a7d7ec8cc00a3feef8c8588eb92b09f54537520539cda5b245", "ja": "水と油ですね♪　でもでも、乳化させれば\nおいしいソースになりますから！", "zh": "简直是水和油呢♪　不过不过，只要让它们乳化，就能做成美味的酱汁啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "02dc8ad8bf14398987fcd88f031034a07f11c50bc53978a5223fb0a3f3d46e32", "ja": "水と油のパートナー、ね。\n……まあ、何にせようまくいけばいいや。", "zh": "水和油的搭档，对吧。\n……总之，只要能顺利就行啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "cd9ea8381df66bab48a1ce6f4c9c75e630fe74cef34d56640f419c92e429225a", "ja": "……。ふたりに関しては、私も注意を\n払っておきます～。それで、今日の議題は～？", "zh": "……。关于她们两个人，我也会留意的～\n那么，今天的议题是～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "02b8592f47ed1b62a39e74ec65093ca0a2b8bf37d204542d542c52b7f2af14f1", "ja": "あっ、えっと。拡張した庭園に増やす、植物の件。\n素材の希望も多いし、マンドラゴラでいいかな？", "zh": "啊，那个……关于要在扩建后的庭园里增加的植物。\n大家想要的素材也很多，就用曼德拉草可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "7a1bdffc002b41c4db57a9283681c6548c2b53ee0ad8a88749a4415e3d6b4289", "ja": "真美先生、ちょっと元気なかったですね。\n……やっぱり、パートナーの事だからかな。", "zh": "真美老师刚才好像有点没精神呢。\n……果然，还是因为搭档的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "ef48b8e9deb57cda98df6bb57a22ea40bcdeb73f489ce5711a0455b3eecd6940", "ja": "そうですね～。真美先生と亜美さん……ふたりは、\nパートナーを解消したわけではありませんが……。", "zh": "是啊～真美老师和亚美……两人虽然没有解除搭档关系，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "c4679dc500093b581d0efa02b09abb1dc68f76b048cf0ecb74db2263ebc28763", "ja": "教師と生徒……立場が分かれてしまった事に、\n違いはありませんから。いろいろあるのでしょう～。", "zh": "老师与学生……立场产生了分歧，\n这也是不争的事实。想必也是各有各的难处吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_02_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "bd2b6539f32739f2e781d01b1e3f61de366e9076754e302a1c488031c74e8aeb", "ja": "そっか。……ふたりとも、前みたいに\n仲良くできるといいんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。……要是你们两个还能像以前一样好好相处就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
